# Kowork office runtime — top-level Python deps (shared by the document skills).
# Regenerate the lock after editing this file:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.lock --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12
#
# The committed lock is portable across all target platforms: versions are fully
# pinned and --generate-hashes records every published wheel hash (lxml ships
# per-platform wheels, so the lock lists all of them). build-runtime.ts consumes
# this lock as-is on each platform via `pip install --require-hashes`; CI does NOT
# regenerate it per runner. Bump a version here, re-run the command above, and
# commit both files together.
